## What it is

A squad-based hero shooter with distinctive character abilities and battle royale competition.

## Is this your kind of game?

Choose this if coordinated squad play and learning character abilities appeal to you. Watch an ordinary match sequence to understand the pace between encounters, rather than judging only a highlight reel.

## Download and purchase

The base game is listed as free to play; optional purchases may be available. Use the official Steam button on this page to open the publisher's listing. Installation is handled by Steam; GameNews does not host installers or game files.

The Steam listing identifies an EA account requirement. Review its current account and installation conditions before starting the download.

## What the Steam listing shows

Checked 23 November 2026. Steam lists Respawn as the developer and Electronic Arts as the publisher, with a Steam release date of 4 November 2020. The listed modes are online PvP and online co-op. Steam does not list a single-player mode. It does list full controller support and in-app purchases.

The minimum column asks for 64-bit Windows 10, an Intel Core i3 6300 or AMD FX 4350, 6 GB of memory, an NVIDIA GeForce GTX 950 or AMD Radeon HD 7790 with 2 GB, DirectX 12, a broadband connection, and 75 GB of storage. Steam notes about 3.8 GB for each localized language. It also says an EA account is required, and that the account can be linked to Steam.

## Sources and editorial basis

Product information checked against the [official Steam listing](https://store.steampowered.com/app/1172470/?l=english) on 16 October 2026 and rechecked on 23 November 2026. Selected with reference to [Steam's most-played chart](https://store.steampowered.com/charts/mostplayed/). This is a researched profile, not a hands-on review or a search-volume ranking. Live prices, player counts, and performance scores are intentionally not quoted.
